    "notes": "Linux Computer Pass consent now checks native capability before offering Control and reserves a working emergency-stop shortcut with safe alternatives. Observe remains available when shortcut registration is unavailable. Broad Computer Control remains unqualified and is not enabled. Real packaged X11 shortcut-conflict, emergency-stop and beta.12-to-beta.13 installed upgrade tests passed for AppImage and Debian, with encrypted synthetic state retained. Mac/Windows packages and stable selection are unchanged.",
